837	In order to apply the stability lemma of \S \ref{subsection:stability-lemma}, we need to construct a function from the solution group to the group of unitaries. 
838	We already have functions defined on the generators: those which send $e\mapsto A_e^{(v_e)}$ and $e\mapsto B_e$. We would like to say ``extend $f_A$ and $f_B$ to all of $\G$ by multiplication''. However, these functions are not quite homomorphisms, so different choices of how to ``extend by multiplication'' define different functions. We'll use our canonical form $\can$ to make that choice in a consistent way. 
