915			\\&\leq \sum_{e\in \can(g)} 
916			\drho\rho{A_e^{(v_e)}\otimes B_e}{I_{AB}}.
917		\end{align}
918		Each word in the canonical form must use at most $\Delta$ occurences of each generator, since all such occurences appear in a group picture with the word on the boundary. So we have
919		\begin{align}
920			\sum_{e\in \can(g)} 
921			\drho\rho{A_e^{(v_e)}\otimes B_e}{I_{AB}}
922			&\leq \Delta\sum_{e\in E} 
923			\drho\rho{A_e^{(v_e)}\otimes B_e}{I_{AB}}
924			\\&\leq \Delta \eta.
